      <chord name="D"/>When Christ <chord name="Bm"/>was <chord name="A"/>lifted <chord name="Em/G"/>from <chord name="G"/>the <chord name="Bm"/>earth <chord name="A/C#"/>His <chord name="D"/>arms stretched <chord name="G"/>out above<br/>
