      <lines>
      <chord name="D"/>Still east <chord name="Bm"/>and <chord name="A"/>west <chord name="Bm"/>His <chord name="Em/G"/>love <chord name="G"/>extends <chord name="A/C#"/>and <chord name="D"/>always, <chord name="G"/>near or <chord name="Em"/>far,<br/>
